    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/eeb37b5e-3647-400e-bce6-b3687b95d31f-image.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 212px;\" /></p><p>Optical path length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#956;OB</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><msup><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><msup><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br />From Snell&rsquo;s law,<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><msup><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><msup><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math><br />Optical path length <math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
